  "raw_html": "<main id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-background\"><section class=\"py-24 lg:py-32 border-b border-border\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\" style=\"opacity:0;will-change:opacity,transform;transform:translateY(24px)\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 mb-3\">Talent Acquisition</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-foreground leading-tight tracking-tight\">Hire Engineers Who <span class=\"brand\">Build,</span> Not Just Theorize</h1><p class=\"mt-6 text-[17px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-2xl\">SCAI graduates are trained under active practitioners across AI engineering, data science, and cloud systems. They enter the workforce with verified project portfolios, production exposure, and the technical clarity to contribute from day one.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold transition-colors\" href=\"#contact\">Request Talent</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-border hover:border-indigo-400 text-foreground text-sm font-semibold transition-colors\" href=\"https://wa.me/918076259052\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">WhatsApp Us</a></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-px bg-border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-border\" style=\"opacity:0;will-change:opacity,transform;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-background px-6 py-6 sm:py-8 flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-foreground\">500+</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Graduates Ready to Hire</p></div><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-background px-6 py-6 sm:py-8 flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-foreground\">80+</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Hiring Partners</p></div><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-background px-6 py-6 sm:py-8 flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-foreground\">15+</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Job Profiles Available</p></div><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-background px-6 py-6 sm:py-8 flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-foreground\">0–3 yrs</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Hands-On Experience</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-border\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mb-12\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 mb-3\">Hiring Profiles</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">Across Every Critical <span class=\"brand\">Technical Domain</span></h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground text-[15px] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">From generative AI systems and ML pipelines to data infrastructure and cloud operations — SCAI trains practitioners across the roles companies are actively scaling into.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-8\"><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors border bg-indigo-600 text-white border-indigo-600\">AI &amp; Machine Learning</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors border border-border text-muted-foreground hover:border-indigo-400 hover:text-foreground\">Data Engineering</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors border border-border text-muted-foreground hover:border-indigo-400 hover:text-foreground\">Web Development</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors border border-border text-muted-foreground hover:border-indigo-400 hover:text-foreground\">DevOps &amp; Cloud</button></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5\" style=\"opacity:0;will-change:opacity,transform;transform:translateY(10px)\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/60 mb-4\">Job Profiles</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><div class=\"px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/20 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/40 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400\">AI Engineer</div><div class=\"px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/20 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/40 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400\">Machine Learning Engineer</div><div class=\"px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/20 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/40 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400\">Data Scientist</div><div class=\"px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/20 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/40 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400\">NLP Engineer</div><div class=\"px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/20 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/40 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400\">Computer Vision Engineer</div><div class=\"px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/20 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/40 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400\">Generative AI Engineer</div><div class=\"px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/20 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/40 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400\">MLOps Engineer</div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/60 mb-4\">Tools &amp; Technologies</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground\">Python</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground\">PyTorch</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground\">TensorFlow</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground\">Scikit-learn</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground\">Hugging Face</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground\">LangChain</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground\">OpenCV</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground\">spaCy</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground\">FastAPI</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground\">Docker</span></div><div class=\"mt-auto pt-5 border-t border-border\"><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">All graduates complete domain-specific capstone projects and demonstrate working knowledge of these technologies through verifiable portfolios.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-border\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 mb-3\">Why SCAI Graduates</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">What Makes Our Talent <span class=\"brand\">Stand Apart</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto text-[15px] leading-relaxed\">SCAI doesn't produce certificate-holders. It produces engineers who have built, debugged, and shipped real AI systems — under the guidance of practitioners who do the same every day.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5\"><div class=\"p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/30 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/40 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span class=\"text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-bold text-sm\">01</span></div><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Trained by Industry Practitioners</h3><p class=\"text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">SCAI graduates learn directly from engineers working in AI, data, and cloud production environments — not from textbooks. Every module is grounded in real systems, real failures, and real design decisions.</p></div><div class=\"p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/30 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/40 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span class=\"text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-bold text-sm\">02</span></div><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Capstone-Proven Before Day One</h3><p class=\"text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">From model deployment pipelines to end-to-end data products, our learners complete multi-stage projects before they enter the workforce. They arrive as contributors, not observers.</p></div><div class=\"p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/30 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/40 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span class=\"text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-bold text-sm\">03</span></div><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Deep Technical Competency by Role</h3><p class=\"text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Whether you need an ML engineer, a data analyst, or a cloud specialist, SCAI graduates build genuine depth in their domain — not surface-level familiarity stretched across a generic curriculum.</p></div><div class=\"p-7 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/30 border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-900/40 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><span class=\"text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-bold text-sm\">04</span></div><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Designed for Scalable Hiring</h3><p class=\"text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Our cohort-based model produces graduates at consistent quality on a regular cycle. Whether you're filling one role or building an entire AI team, we have structured pipelines to match your timeline.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-border\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 mb-3\">Learner Categories</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">Built for Roles Your <span class=\"brand\">Team Actually Needs</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto text-[15px] leading-relaxed\">Each SCAI program is designed around the real demands of a specific technical role — not a generic curriculum stretched across titles to hit a higher headcount.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">AI &amp; ML Engineers</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Trained in model development, experimentation, feature engineering, and production model deployment.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Data Scientists</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Skilled in statistical analysis, hypothesis testing, and translating business problems into data-driven insight.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Generative AI Engineers</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Proficient in LLMs, RAG architectures, prompt engineering, and agentic AI system design.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Data Analysts</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Experienced with SQL, BI tools, dashboards, and structured thinking across analytics workflows.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Data Engineers</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Capable of building robust data pipelines, transformation layers, and cloud-based data infrastructure.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">MLOps &amp; DevOps Engineers</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Focused on deployment automation, model monitoring, CI/CD, and scalable cloud operations.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-border bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950/20\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 mb-3\">How It Works</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">From Requirement to Offer <span class=\"brand\">in Days, Not Months</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-muted-foreground max-w-xl mx-auto text-[15px] leading-relaxed\">A lean, structured process designed to get the right candidate in front of you quickly — without the overhead of traditional recruitment cycles.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white dark:bg-background flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black text-indigo-100 dark:text-indigo-950 leading-none select-none\">01</span><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Share Your Requirements</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Tell us the role, tech stack, experience level, and engagement type. A brief form or a direct message works.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white dark:bg-background flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black text-indigo-100 dark:text-indigo-950 leading-none select-none\">02</span><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">We Match and Shortlist</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Our team reviews the active graduate pool and surfaces profiles that fit your criteria within 48–72 hours.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white dark:bg-background flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black text-indigo-100 dark:text-indigo-950 leading-none select-none\">03</span><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">You Interview, We Support</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Review resumes, conduct interviews, and run technical assessments. We facilitate the full process end-to-end.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white dark:bg-background flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black text-indigo-100 dark:text-indigo-950 leading-none select-none\">04</span><h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug\">Hire With Confidence</h3><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Onboard pre-vetted, project-backed engineers — ready to contribute from their first week.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-border\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 mb-3\">What's Included</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground\">Everything Included in <span class=\"brand\">Every Engagement</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-muted-foreground max-w-xl mx-auto text-[15px] leading-relaxed\">No hidden conditions, no surprise fees. Everything you need to find, evaluate, and hire the right candidate is included from the first conversation.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Nationwide Talent Pool</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Graduates are available across metro and Tier-2 cities for both remote and on-site roles.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Zero Recruitment Fees</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Access our entire hiring pipeline without placement charges, agency fees, or hidden costs.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Full-Time or Internship-Ready</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Flexible engagement options to match your team's headcount strategy and current openings.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">0–3 Years of Hands-On Experience</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Entry-level and junior profiles built to integrate into existing engineering teams with minimal onboarding.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Fast Candidate Shortlisting</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Submit your requirements and receive curated, pre-vetted candidate profiles within 48–72 hours.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Interview-Ready Graduates</p><p class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">All candidates go through mock interviews, technical assessments, and communication preparation before placement.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-28\" id=\"contact\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><div><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 mb-3\">Start Hiring</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground leading-snug\">Tell Us What You Need. <span class=\"brand\">We'll Find the Right Fit.</span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Share your open role and hiring criteria. Our team will shortlist pre-vetted SCAI graduates matched to your requirements and set up introductions within days — not weeks.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col gap-0.5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card hover:border-indigo-400 transition-colors\" href=\"mailto:hire@schoolofcoreai.com\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/60\">Email</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground group-hover:text-indigo-600 dark:group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors\">hire@schoolofcoreai.com</span></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col gap-0.5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card hover:border-indigo-400 transition-colors\" href=\"https://wa.me/918076259052\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer